{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36874","headline":"登宛陵条风楼寄窦常侍 · 罗隐","name":"登宛陵条风楼寄窦常侍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乱罹时节懒登临，试借条风半日吟。\n只有远山含煖律，不知高阁动归心。\n溪喧晚棹千声浪，云护寒郊数丈阴。\n自笑疎慵似麇鹿，也教台上费黄金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36874.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36874","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}